Hardened the tunnel-status endpoint: the lookup now restricts by Nautobot ObjectPermissions (VPNTunnel view), so a token without vpn.view_vpntunnel gets 404 for every tunnel instead of reading its status and PSK. Superusers and the scoped portal service account are unaffected. Prod: grant the portal service account vpn.view_vpntunnel (see docs/design/2026-07-22-tunnel-status-authorization.md).
